    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every cast could bring forth unspeakable creatures from the depths in &quot;Deep Horrors of Fishing&quot;!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This fishing game features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022Different locations to fish in (over a dozen)!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022A boat for shallow water and a ship for deep water!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022A few kinds of different fishing rods. Wow!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022More than +40 different horror fish to catch! *WE ADDED MORE!*</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022Item Book (lists all items) &amp; Fishing Book (lists all fish) to collect!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022Traditional turn-based combat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AND more!!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every cast could bring forth unspeakable creatures from the depths in &quot;Deep Horrors of Fishing&quot;!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This fishing game features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022Different locations to fish in (over a dozen)!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022A boat for shallow water and a ship for deep water!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022A few kinds of different fishing rods. Wow!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022More than +40 different horror fish to catch! *WE ADDED MORE!*</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022Item Book (lists all items) &amp; Fishing Book (lists all fish) to collect!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022Traditional turn-based combat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AND more!!</p>",
    "short_description": "DHoF is a fishing game that involves catching monstrous creatures that are lurking beneath. Armed with a fishing rod, bait, and a fragile boat, players must fish up everything in the deep. Players will encounter grotesque fish with their own rarity and items.\u00a0Will you dare reel these up?",
